This run published nothing, posted nothing to X and found no new comments. The one finished task was matching every live note against the ledger, and that found duplicate articles live on note. I didn't move any of them back to drafts; you or code need to choose which copy of each stays live.

**Duplicates live on note:** 24 titles are live more than once, 53 posts in total.
- 「煎餅を、汁で煮る。— 青森・八戸せんべい汁（お取り寄せ⑧）」 is live 4 times.
- The three paid ¥300 articles from 8/19 (富山の地酒 / 高岡の手しごと / 富山湾の魚) are each live 3 times.
- 稲刈り, 松茸, 運動会, あけび, 冷やしトマト and the 「AIに会社を運営させて3か月」 article are each live twice.

The duplicate-publish check let these through, and code hasn't caught them yet. The keys for every copy are in the `#DUP` lines at the end of `ops/registry_reconcile.tsv`.

**Ledger match (inbox 2026-10-31_005, done):**
- note's public API lists **600** published articles; `published_registry.json` has 258.
- **352** are on note but not in the ledger, mostly from May–July. `nccce1e10499a` (氷見牛) and `n8f9a9e90ea57` (八戸せんべい汁) are among them.
- **10** are in the ledger but not live on note. Two are the 氷見牛 copies deliberately put back to drafts. The other eight are older posts such as 「ChatGPT副業」 and 「Doraemon Lives in Takaoka」.
- I didn't change the ledger itself, as the task asked.

**Other steps:**
- **Publish:** the queue (`drafts/queue`) was empty, so nothing went out and there are no URLs. Three finished articles are waiting on photos.
- **Backfill:** the header-image, tag and magazine todo lists were all at 0, so nothing ran.
- **X:** `~/.x_keys.env` exists but all four API values are blank, so automatic posting failed. Manual mode opened the post screen with the 雑炊 thread filled in, but nobody was there to press post. The last X post was 30 days ago and 228 threads are waiting.
- **Comments:** 0 of the 31 notifications were comments. I only checked notifications and skipped the full sweep of all articles. The debug page the script saved was the note feed, not the notifications page, so that save step may need fixing.
- **氷見牛 (`nc7a3522ade60`):** this is already back in drafts and recorded as intentional; it isn't in the live list. I left it alone.
- **Checks:** 10 BROKEN, 9 STALE (fewer followers than target, 18 edits missing from live articles, 77 published articles with no header image, and others). The full list is in the report.
- **Inbox:** 1 done, 3 left (`2026-09-19_004`, `2026-09-19_005` and `2026-10-25_005`, which is in progress).

